<section aria-labelledby="study-depth-heading"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="study-depth-heading">Study Depth</h2><span class="badge badge-info"><?= (int)($study['total_resources'] ?? 0) ?> resources</span></div><div class="ui-metric-grid"><article class="card stat-card"><span class="stat-label">Question-rich / study-poor</span><strong class="stat-value"><?= count($study['question_rich_study_poor'] ?? []) ?></strong></article><article class="card stat-card"><span class="stat-label">Single-resource concentrations</span><strong class="stat-value"><?= count($study['many_questions_single_resource'] ?? []) ?></strong></article><article class="card stat-card"><span class="stat-label">Orphan materials</span><strong class="stat-value"><?= count($study['orphan_materials'] ?? []) ?></strong><span class="muted">editorial review</span></article></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><caption class="sr-only">Study depth warnings</caption><thead><tr><th>Target</th><th>Warning</th><th>Metrics</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach (array_slice($study['warnings'] ?? [], 0, 30) as $warning): ?><tr><th scope="row"><code><?= $escape($warning['target'] ?? '') ?></code></th><td><?= $escape($warning['code'] ?? '') ?></td><td><?= $escape(json_encode($warning['metrics'] ?? [], JSON_UNESCAPED_SLASHES)) ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><p class="muted">Standalone foundation resources remain editorial warnings unless structural references are invalid.</p></section>

<section aria-labelledby="diversity-heading"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="diversity-heading">Content Diversity</h2><span class="badge badge-info">Descriptive signals</span></div><div class="ui-metric-grid"><article class="card stat-card"><span class="stat-label">Overconcentrated areas</span><strong class="stat-value"><?= count($depth['overconcentrated_areas'] ?? []) ?></strong></article><article class="card stat-card"><span class="stat-label">Low-diversity areas</span><strong class="stat-value"><?= count($depth['low_diversity_areas'] ?? []) ?></strong></article></div><p class="muted">Format concentration is a review signal, not an automatic requirement: topics do not all need figures, tables, or numeric items.</p></section>

<section aria-labelledby="integrity-summary-heading"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="integrity-summary-heading">Integrity</h2><span class="badge <?= $escape($statusClass) ?>"><?= $escape($status) ?></span></div><div class="record-list"><div class="metric-row"><strong>Missing eligibility</strong><span><?= (int)($integrityPortfolio['total_missing_eligibility'] ?? 0) ?></span></div><div class="metric-row"><strong>Invalid eligibility</strong><span><?= (int)($integrityPortfolio['total_invalid_eligibility'] ?? 0) ?></span></div><div class="metric-row"><strong>Unlinked questions</strong><span><?= (int)($integrityPortfolio['total_unlinked'] ?? 0) ?></span></div><div class="metric-row"><strong>Invalid links / taxonomy references</strong><span><?= (int)($integrityPortfolio['total_invalid_links'] ?? 0) ?> / <?= (int)($integrityPortfolio['total_invalid_taxonomy_refs'] ?? 0) ?></span></div><div class="metric-row"><strong>Broken assets / invalid answers</strong><span><?= (int)($integrityPortfolio['total_broken_assets'] ?? 0) ?> / <?= (int)($integrityPortfolio['total_invalid_answer_keys'] ?? 0) ?></span></div><div class="metric-row"><strong>Accidental cards / key collisions</strong><span><?= (int)($integrityPortfolio['total_accidental_non_derivable'] ?? 0) ?> / <?= (int)($integrityPortfolio['total_card_key_collisions'] ?? 0) ?></span></div></div><p class="muted">All structural integrity calculations come from ContentIntegrityService. Concept fit remains editorial review.</p></section>

